There were a ton of really cool facts from
behind the scenes stuff in season 4 too.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.990
Like they wrote a full backstory for that
funeral home Beth and Daryl found that never

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.900
made it past the script phase.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.350
Hello to any new people, if you're just finding
me for the first time.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.830
I'm doing weekly Walking Dead bonus videos
while we wait for Season 5 to get here.

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:29.289
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

